@startuml
skinparam backgroundColor #FCFCFA
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam defaultFontName DejaVu Sans
title UML Sequence — Framing and Evidence-Producing Delivery (G0–G7)

actor Sponsor
actor Engineer
participant "MTP-to-Run\nAssistant" as AI
participant "Human Gate\nService" as Gate
participant "CI/CD" as CI
participant Testbed as TB
participant "OTEL / Evidence" as EV
participant "Test and Release\nAuthorities" as TA

Sponsor -> Gate: G0 mandate, sources and authority
Gate --> Sponsor: Auditable G0 disposition
Engineer -> AI: Classify selected inputs and assumptions
Engineer -> Gate: Request G1 input-fitness review
Gate --> Engineer: Auditable G1 disposition
Engineer -> Gate: Submit baseline, thresholds, budget and protocol
Sponsor -> Gate: Decide P0 phase exit
Gate --> Engineer: P0 proceed, narrow or stop
Engineer -> AI: Request manifest and BOM alternatives
AI --> Engineer: Candidate, trade-offs and evidence obligations
Engineer -> Gate: Request G2 architecture/BOM review
Gate --> Engineer: Auditable G2 disposition
Engineer -> AI: Request IaC, tests and documentation drafts
AI --> Engineer: Pull request with provenance
Engineer -> CI: Submit reviewed candidate
CI -> CI: Schema, lint, unit, policy and plan checks
CI -> Gate: Request G3 IaC-quality disposition
Gate --> CI: G3 conditions or rejection
CI -> CI: SBOM, secret, licence and vulnerability checks
CI -> Gate: Request independent G4 cyber disposition
Gate --> CI: G4 conditions or rejection
CI -> TB: Apply candidate in isolated testbed
CI -> TB: Execute health, performance, resilience and rollback
TB -> EV: Traces, logs, metrics, events and observations
CI -> Gate: Request G5 execution disposition
Gate --> CI: G5 credibility and representativity decision
EV -> EV: Validate evidence-envelope completeness
EV -> Gate: Request G6 evidence disposition
Gate --> TA: Evidence package, G6 decision and gaps
TA -> TA: Assess residual risk and uncertainty
TA -> Gate: Record G7 GO / CONDITIONAL GO / NO-GO
Gate --> Sponsor: Attributable delivery decision record

note over Gate,TA
G3 and G4 remain distinct decisions with different accountable roles.
No pilot execution starts before P0 approval.
No production apply is autonomous.
end note
@enduml
